      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "title": {
        "en": "Compassionate and knowledgeable veterinarians"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently praise the veterinary team and clinic staff for their kindness, deep medical expertise, and reassuring demeanor. Long-time clients and new visitors alike note that doctors take time to listen to concerns, conduct thorough evaluations, and explain treatment plans in clear, approachable language."
      },
      "mentions": 60
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle handling for stressed pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers frequently emphasize how comfortably and tenderly their pets are treated during routine checkups and urgent visits. Pet parents appreciate that veterinary staff handle fearful dogs and sensitive cats with great patience, creating a calm atmosphere that minimizes stress during examinations and injections."
      },
      "mentions": 37
    },
    {
      "topic": "place",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "title": {
        "en": "Welcoming and orderly neighborhood clinic"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients regularly comment on the clean, tidy condition of the facility and the cheerful, prompt assistance provided at the reception desk. Many pet owners highlight the welcoming environment in Leaside, noting that the clinic runs efficiently with minimal waiting room delays and comfortable exam spaces."
      },
      "mentions": 28
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Can urgent veterinary cases be accommodated without prior booking?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Reviewers note that the clinic staff kindly accommodated pets needing prompt attention on short notice when urgent concerns arose."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "What preventative care services are available for cats and dogs?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "The clinic provides comprehensive wellness exams, core vaccinations, dental assessments, parasite prevention, and routine diagnostic testing."
      },
      "basis": "website"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "How does the veterinary team interact with nervous animals?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Clients consistently report that the veterinarians and technicians use gentle, patient techniques that put fearful pets at ease during visits."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Are after-hours emergency services provided on site?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "After regular operating hours, clients are referred to local emergency veterinary hospitals for critical care and continuous overnight monitoring."
      },
      "basis": "website"
    }
